# November 20, 2026: Concord, with the Battle Road in Lincoln and Lexington and one house in Bedford (Middlesex County,
# Massachusetts), region bos, drawn at random by tools/choose.py. The Atlas had nothing within 11 km of Concord.
# Facts come from sources opened in this session: Wikipedia read as raw text (wiki_raw.py), HMdb marker pages (the
# National Park Service's own trail signs), nps.gov pages for Minute Man National Historical Park, and the managing
# bodies' own pages read through tools/page.py (thetrustees.org, louisamayalcott.org, robbinshouse.org,
# concordscolonialinn.com, joblanefarmmuseum.org, concordmuseum.org). mass.gov (Walden Pond) refused, and the Emerson
# House's own site would not open; those entries say "hours not checked".
